### Description

The `add` command does not recognize GitHub Enterprise (GHE) custom domain URLs as GitHub repositories. For example, `https://github.mycompany.com/org/repo` is not treated as a `github` source type.

In `src/source-parser.ts`, the `parseSource()` function uses regex patterns that hardcode `github.com`:

```typescript
// Line 157 - GitHub URL with path
const githubTreeWithPathMatch = input.match(/github\.com\/([^/]+)\/([^/]+)\/tree\/([^/]+)\/(.+)/);

// Line 169 - GitHub URL with branch only
const githubTreeMatch = input.match(/github\.com\/([^/]+)\/([^/]+)\/tree\/([^/]+)$/);
